{% comment %}
  Hello Little Joy — Order confirmation (OI)

  Product images prefer the live variant/product catalog photo, then the
  order line-item snapshot. Do not use img_url crop/scale — those pin stale
  Shopify CDN derivatives so photos do not update in sent emails.

  Publish into Shopify: Settings → Notifications → Order confirmation →
  replace Email body (HTML) → Save.
{% endcomment %}
{% capture recType %}OI{% endcapture %}
