                            <img id="responsiveImage" src="https://spentlystorageaccount.blob.core.windows.net/images/a37a6f83928a4c1ba6bdddaa9a087934" alt="Hello Little Joy" width="200" style="vertical-align: bottom;max-width: 100%; width:200px;" />
